Notice of modifications (LGPL-3.0 / GPL-3.0 section 5a)
------------------------------------------------------

This is a modified version of PocketMine-MP. It has been changed from the
original PocketMine-MP 5.44.3 source by the BetterPMMP project in 2026.

Every source file, launcher script and vendored library file that BetterPMMP
modified carries a one-line notice near its license header stating that it was
modified by the BetterPMMP project, together with the year of modification.
Files added by BetterPMMP name the BetterPMMP Team as their author in their own
header. Machine-managed data files - among them source/resources/pocketmine.yml,
source/resources/resource_packs.yml, the translation files under
source/resources/translations/ and source/composer.json - are modified without
an in-line notice and are covered by this file instead.

The complete corresponding source code is included in the source/ directory of
this distribution.


Third-party components
----------------------

The source/vendor/ directory contains third-party libraries, each distributed
under its own license as stated in that library's own LICENSE file, which is
retained unmodified.

One of those libraries is modified by BetterPMMP:

  source/vendor/pocketmine/raklib/src/server/Server.php

It is changed to slice the inter-tick sleep of the RakLib thread so that
outbound packet batches are picked up within about a millisecond instead of up
to a full 10 ms tick. The file carries the same one-line modification notice
near its license header, and the diff is kept in
source/build/betterpmmp-vendor-patches/ because a composer install or update
overwrites the vendor tree and reverts it. RakLib is
distributed under the GPL-3.0 with the exception stated in its own LICENSE.md,
which is retained unmodified.

The source/bin/ directory contains a build of PHP together with its extensions
and supporting libraries, distributed under the PHP License v3.01 and the
respective licenses of the bundled components. See source/bin/php/license.txt.


